<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is seeing a surge of violent criminal activity, including a gang highway robbery of soybeans that will be sold at a 400% markup, and the murder of two local election candidates in El Oro. Journalist Tomás Beltrán Conforme was shot dead outside his home despite witness protection, and a police officer was killed with three colleagues abducted after a checkpost attack. These incidents add to ongoing prison gang fights that left dozens of inmates dead and U.S. military operations against cartels. The crisis now includes high-profile heists and targeted killings, whereas earlier reporting focused on prison violence and drug arrests. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPRHR3TFVieDBkRGxBVWd3S0xNejlPWTZNZkJYTjdCM25PWEtOZndTRF9IQVJaTVNOTV83OWlhc3g1VjNLRF9iNllqd1VMUzZ0cHVtZmpMMk1vamJ4Zk1kdHlDclROOWdIc3hxWDNhQW5pbi1lZnBKT0FIbks4eWJkZFV2UWdBaUNJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1zamxrUk1wR3Jzc0ZoMGJwaVF3OHVxYm9raHBEME1WX21rV2xfT2tPVjVzUVRxY2szLUUyd194bWQ0eGdVLUZFc3NLZ0ZoY2wtTlgwRk54WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangladesh Sangbad Sangstha (BSS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE9RSDRkQ3FlalhPa1pNTWkybmxrN1FDUnFhcUtrYThlN256dDdYZ25ZZlFPYXZ1SFhtd1U2M1FoUjktMW14dUt5Nzhhd3VNNUxHaldmT210bFNjVThhc1V